 ordinary join above, on a right-side column             | ok                                                                                                     | t      |  1988 |       0 |     0
 LEFT join above, on a right-side column                 | ok                                                                                                     | t      |  2000 |       0 |     0
 two ASOF joins in a row                                 | ok                                                                                                     | t      |  2000 |       0 |     0
